{"id":"vod_hh_55647","vodId":"55647","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"日本国有铁道公安队","name_cn":"日本国有铁道公安队","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/604580f858a76a3c0da9a8cf74c68903.jpg"},"summary":"在平行世界的日本，铁道国有化根深蒂固。就读于桐生铁道高中的高山直人（福山润 配音）梦想进入国铁担任火车司机，从此过上安安稳稳的生活。为此他进入学生铁道OJT参加培训，并在此结识了性格过激的暴力女樱井葵（沼仓爱美 配音）和头脑简单四肢发达的岩泉翔（日野聪 配音）等人。好不容易通过了OJT的测试，结果直人他们却被分配到了东京中央铁路公安室第四警戒班。原来国铁长期赤字，许多地方线路长期废弃。为此有很多组织以极端的手段要求国家将铁路实现民营化，于是铁道公安队应运而生。直人他们成为铁路上不可或缺的重要存在……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-09-29 18:54:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/oeENmONa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QbYkNp0e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/7axZwqJd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/xboNkRza/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/negBNY9d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ZdP2Amza/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/7e5qXnxe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/zbqP9wra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mbkJP9xa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/zbqP9w3a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QdJVrDDd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/kaz2oVra/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:03.233Z"}